{"id":"c43e7408e2d17f49","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower.md","title":"ZFC Largecard4 Extender Ultrapower","display":"df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower — ZFC Largecard4 Extender Ultrapower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower — ZFC Largecard4 Extender Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender]]","[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation]]","[[58-df-zfc-model10-mostowski-collapse-target]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard4-extender-ultrapower — ZFC Largecard4 Extender Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c11b408c5a26a920\" href=\"?note=c11b408c5a26a920\" title=\"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender\">58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6e2250a95e86cd5\" href=\"?note=a6e2250a95e86cd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation\">58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"927e06c69ae1bc9e\" href=\"?note=927e06c69ae1bc9e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model10-mostowski-collapse-target\">58-df-zfc-model10-mostowski-collapse-target</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper\">../batch06/58-df-proper</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is a transitive set model, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\((\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span>-extender, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a transitive-collapse target.</li>\n<li>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq\\lambda\">\\(a\\subseteq\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inc}(a):|a|\\to a\">\\(\\operatorname{inc}(a):|a|\\to a\\)</span> 是递增枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat u_a=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{inc}(a)(i),u(i)\\rangle:i&lt;|a|\\}\">\\(\\widehat u_a=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{inc}(a)(i),u(i)\\rangle:i&lt;|a|\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\kappa^{|a|}\">\\(u\\in\\kappa^{|a|}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\">\\(D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\)</span> is the set of indexed representative functions, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\">\\(\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\)</span> is extender equality, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\">\\(R_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\)</span> is extender membership on equivalence classes.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in N\">\\(x\\in N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{x,\\kappa}\\in N^{\\kappa^\\varnothing}\">\\(c_{x,\\kappa}\\in N^{\\kappa^\\varnothing}\\)</span> is the constant function with value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S\\)</span> is the predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash\nD_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,f\\rangle:a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa^a,N)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}representatives}\\vdash\nD_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,f\\rangle:a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa^a,N)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}constant}\\vdash\nc_{x,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,x\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}constant}\\vdash\nc_{x,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,x\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\n\\langle a,f\\rangle\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\langle b,g\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\land\n\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright a)=g(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright b)\\}\\in E(a\\cup b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\n\\langle a,f\\rangle\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\langle b,g\\rangle\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\land\n\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright a)=g(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright b)\\}\\in E(a\\cup b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda})\\land\nU_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\coloneqq D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}/\\!\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda})\\land\nU_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\coloneqq D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}/\\!\\equiv_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}membership}\\vdash\nR_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle[\\langle a,f\\rangle]_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},[\\langle b,g\\rangle]_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\right\\rangle:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright a)\\in g(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright b)\\}\\in E(a\\cup b)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}membership}\\vdash\nR_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle[\\langle a,f\\rangle]_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda},[\\langle b,g\\rangle]_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\right\\rangle:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\langle a,f\\rangle,\\langle b,g\\rangle\\in D_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\{u\\in\\kappa^{|a\\cup b|}:f(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright a)\\in g(\\widehat u_{a\\cup b}\\upharpoonright b)\\}\\in E(a\\cup b)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}diagonal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(j_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}^0,N,U_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda})\\land\n\\forall x\\in N\\;j_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}^0(x)=[\\langle\\varnothing,c_{x,\\kappa}\\rangle]_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}diagonal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Function}(j_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}^0,N,U_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda})\\land\n\\forall x\\in N\\;j_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}^0(x)=[\\langle\\varnothing,c_{x,\\kappa}\\rangle]_{E,\\kappa,\\lambda}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S(N,E,M,\\kappa,\\lambda,j_E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\land\\kappa,\\lambda\\in N\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda},U_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\pi\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S(M,U_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda},R_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda},\\pi)\\land\nj_E=\\pi\\circ j_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}^0\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak N,\\mathfrak M\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j_E,\\mathfrak N,\\mathfrak M)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j_E(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j_E(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land j_E(\\kappa)\\geq\\lambda\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4ExtenderUltrapower}_S(N,E,M,\\kappa,\\lambda,j_E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(N)\\land\\kappa,\\lambda\\in N\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4Extender}_S(E,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda},U_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\pi\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S(M,U_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda},R_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda},\\pi)\\land\nj_E=\\pi\\circ j_{N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda}^0\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak N,\\mathfrak M\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j_E,\\mathfrak N,\\mathfrak M)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j_E(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j_E(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land j_E(\\kappa)\\geq\\lambda\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An extender ultrapower is not the one-ultrafilter quotient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N^I/U\">\\(N^I/U\\)</span>: representatives have varying finite supports <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(a\\in[\\lambda]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> and are compared after projection to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\cup b\">\\(a\\cup b\\)</span>. Every derived quotient symbol now records <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(N,E,\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The target and embedding are obtained from the well-founded extensional quotient by the explicit Mostowski-collapse relation.</li>\n<li>The target structures are selected by the registered membership-structure predicate, and the critical-point clause is expanded as pointwise fixation below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> together with movement of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender","status":"resolved","id":"c11b408c5a26a920","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-largecard4-extender]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation","status":"resolved","id":"a6e2250a95e86cd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model10-mostowski-collapse-target","status":"resolved","id":"927e06c69ae1bc9e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model10-mostowski-collapse-target]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df